    "expansion_note": "Complete list context may exceed requested count; original blocks unchanged.",
    "blocks": [
      {
        "block_id": "block-000087-02c6e3d3",
        "dom_path": "/html/body/div[99]",
        "image_asset_id": null,
        "layout_role": null,
        "ordinal": 87,
        "reported_page": 5,
        "source_anchor": "i6be430fe3ebf411481dcec8b0abe9149_19",
        "style_signature": {
          "font-family": "'arial',sans-serif",
          "font-size": "10pt",
          "font-weight": "400",
          "line-height": "120%",
          "margin-top": "6pt",
          "text-align": "justify",
          "text-indent": "22.5pt"
        },
        "table": null,
        "text": "We have built world-class advertising technologies for advertisers, agencies, and publishers to power their digital marketing businesses. Our advertising solutions help millions of companies grow their businesses through our wide range of products across devices and formats, and we aim to ensure positive user experiences by serving the right ads at the right time and by building deep partnerships with brands and agencies. AI has been foundational to our advertising business for more than a decade. Products like Demand Gen, Performance Max, and Product Studio use the full power of our AI to help advertisers find untapped and incremental conversion opportunities.",
        "text_hash": "02c6e3d34a01c9f206ace7c047738a79154602c4e1425b716f2c325195410664",
        "type": "paragraph"
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block-000088-0c7f9036",
        "dom_path": "/html/body/div[100]",
        "image_asset_id": null,
        "layout_role": null,
        "ordinal": 88,
        "reported_page": 5,
        "source_anchor": "i6be430fe3ebf411481dcec8b0abe9149_19",
        "style_signature": {
          "font-family": "'arial',sans-serif",
          "font-size": "10pt",
          "font-weight": "400",
          "line-height": "120%",
          "margin-top": "6pt",
          "text-align": "justify",
          "text-indent": "22.5pt"
        },
        "table": null,
        "text": "Google Services generates revenues primarily by delivering both performance and brand advertising that appears on Google Search & other properties, YouTube, and Google Network partners' properties (\"Google Network properties\"). We continue to invest in both performance and brand advertising and seek to improve the measurability of advertising so advertisers understand the effectiveness of their campaigns.",
        "text_hash": "0c7f90368d1c0afccc25c1019c26787fda62248d39a91b6c43d6761b322bd7a1",
        "type": "paragraph"
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block-000089-e4c14dea",
        "dom_path": "/html/body/div[101]",
        "image_asset_id": null,
        "layout_role": null,
        "ordinal": 89,
        "reported_page": 5,
        "source_anchor": "i6be430fe3ebf411481dcec8b0abe9149_19",
        "style_signature": {
          "font-family": "'arial',sans-serif",
          "font-size": "10pt",
          "font-weight": "700",
          "line-height": "120%",
          "margin-top": "6pt",
          "padding-left": "36pt",
          "text-align": "justify",
          "text-indent": "-18pt"
        },
        "table": null,
        "text": "•Performance advertising creates and delivers relevant ads that users will click on leading to direct engagement with advertisers. Performance advertising lets our advertisers connect with users while driving measurable results. Our ads tools allow performance advertisers to create simple text-based ads.",
        "text_hash": "e4c14dea6e1392ccf690818ca9d24be02d6a3339cacb864f5b3bde406626643a",
        "type": "paragraph"
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block-000090-9dac0973",
        "dom_path": "/html/body/div[102]",
        "image_asset_id": null,
        "layout_role": null,
        "ordinal": 90,
        "reported_page": 5,
        "source_anchor": "i6be430fe3ebf411481dcec8b0abe9149_19",
        "style_signature": {
          "font-family": "'arial',sans-serif",
          "font-size": "10pt",
          "font-weight": "700",
          "line-height": "120%",
          "margin-top": "6pt",
          "padding-left": "36pt",
          "text-align": "justify",
          "text-indent": "-18pt"
        },
        "table": null,
        "text": "•Brand advertising helps enhance users' awareness of and affinity for advertisers' products and services, through videos, text, images, and other interactive ads that run across various devices. We help brand advertisers deliver digital videos and other types of ads to specific audiences for their brand-building marketing campaigns.",
        "text_hash": "9dac0973a1e785f28b73570e1d02688aa82354196daa30577d951d3a96142a06",
        "type": "paragraph"
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block-000091-ac27b3a6",
        "dom_path": "/html/body/div[103]",
        "image_asset_id": null,
        "layout_role": null,
        "ordinal": 91,
        "reported_page": 5,
        "source_anchor": "i6be430fe3ebf411481dcec8b0abe9149_19",
        "style_signature": {
          "font-family": "'arial',sans-serif",
          "font-size": "10pt",
          "font-weight": "400",
          "line-height": "120%",
          "margin-top": "6pt",
          "text-align": "justify",
          "text-indent": "22.5pt"
        },
        "table": null,
        "text": "We have allocated substantial resources to stopping bad advertising practices and protecting users on the web. We focus on creating the best advertising experiences for our users and advertisers in many ways, including filtering out invalid traffic, removing billions of bad ads from our systems every year, and closely monitoring the sites, apps, and videos where ads appear and blocklisting them when necessary to ensure that ads do not fund bad content.",
        "text_hash": "ac27b3a629a077793300a177216a37131ba35f2e2ce6e874c9314de0a6d57582",
        "type": "paragraph"
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block-000092-b1521a49",
        "dom_path": "/html/body/div[104]",
        "image_asset_id": null,
        "layout_role": null,
        "ordinal": 92,
        "reported_page": 5,
        "source_anchor": "i6be430fe3ebf411481dcec8b0abe9149_19",
        "style_signature": {
          "font-family": "'arial',sans-serif",
          "font-size": "10pt",
          "font-weight": "400",
          "line-height": "120%",
          "margin-top": "6pt",
          "text-align": "justify",
          "text-indent": "22.5pt"
        },
        "table": null,
        "text": "In addition, Google Services generates revenues from products and services beyond advertising, including:",
        "text_hash": "b1521a490872d564cbed15ae19081309d0df87b94f8a93d66b3c6b61cddadbe9",
        "type": "paragraph"
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block-000093-9da7e695",
        "dom_path": "/html/body/div[105]",
        "image_asset_id": null,
        "layout_role": null,
        "ordinal": 93,
        "reported_page": 5,
        "source_anchor": "i6be430fe3ebf411481dcec8b0abe9149_19",
        "style_signature": {
          "font-family": "'arial',sans-serif",
          "font-size": "10pt",
          "font-weight": "400",
          "line-height": "120%",
          "margin-top": "6pt",
          "padding-left": "36pt",
          "text-align": "justify",
          "text-indent": "-18pt"
        },
        "table": null,
        "text": "•consumer subscriptions, which primarily include revenues from YouTube services, such as YouTube TV, YouTube Music and Premium, and NFL Sunday Ticket, as well as Google One, which offers access to our most capable Gemini models;",
        "text_hash": "9da7e695e75792ccb77496ce6528f9a735ca57113629e471e47e4af14227ba13",
        "type": "paragraph"
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block-000094-0a4cdc1c",
        "dom_path": "/html/body/div[106]",
        "image_asset_id": null,
        "layout_role": null,
        "ordinal": 94,
        "reported_page": 5,
        "source_anchor": "i6be430fe3ebf411481dcec8b0abe9149_19",
        "style_signature": {
          "font-family": "'arial',sans-serif",
          "font-size": "10pt",
          "font-weight": "400",
          "line-height": "120%",
          "margin-top": "6pt",
          "padding-left": "36pt",
          "text-align": "justify",
          "text-indent": "-18pt"
        },
        "table": null,
        "text": "•platforms, which primarily include revenues from Google Play sales of apps and in-app purchases; and",
        "text_hash": "0a4cdc1c763c73b2db10d77e076c3457f5e4fce9abaebfba2a938f21c6a0b541",
        "type": "paragraph"
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block-000095-50fe9352",
